WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.509
Rɩk-y n ges pagb kẽer yelle.

00:00:02.589 --> 00:00:09.720
A Guimbi Ouattara sẽn wa n be Bobo-Dioulasso wã, b ket n dɩkda a togs-n-taare.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:21.740
Sẽn na yɩl n wʋm tẽngã sẽn yɩ to-to wã võore, d segd n kẽnga yʋʋm kob-gĩnd 19 soabã pʋgẽ, wakat ning tẽngã sẽn da boond tɩ Sya wã.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:32.372
A Guimbi ra yita Ouattara, Dioula buudẽ, tɩ b yetame tɩ b yaab rãmbã yita Kong sẽn be Côte d'Ivoire rũndã-rũndã wã.

00:00:32.452 --> 00:00:37.827
B ra tara yõod wʋsg tẽngã politikã pʋgẽ, la kom-biisã pʋgẽ.

00:00:37.907 --> 00:00:45.871
Sã n yaa ne nebã, a Guimbi ra yaa ned sẽn tar yamã, pãn-tõogã, la a sẽn kõt nebã wʋsgo.

00:00:45.951 --> 00:00:49.014
Wakat kãng ra yaa zu-loees wakate.

00:00:49.094 --> 00:01:02.790
Tẽns nins sẽn da be tẽns a taabã sʋka, zabr n da zabd ne taaba, tɩ kom-bɩɩsã bao n paas b naamã, la tɩ tẽnsã ra segd n kogla b mens tɩ b tõog n põse.

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:10.002
B yeelame tɩ a Guimbi Ouattara maana tʋʋmd sẽn tar yõod wʋsg tẽngã koglg pʋgẽ.

00:01:10.082 --> 00:01:18.415
Yʋʋmd 1800 wã saabẽ wã, Europɩɩ rãmb sẽn da wat be tẽn-kãng pʋgẽ wã me goma pag a ye yelle.

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:29.417
Kibs-mitbã ket n zabda ne a pãn-tõog sẽn yaa to-to: a ra yaa rĩm-poak bɩ pag sẽn tar pãn-tusdg la nebã fãa waoogd-a bɩ?

00:01:29.497 --> 00:01:34.687
Pa wakat fãa la d tõe n bãng d sẽn na n maan to-to wã ye.

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:37.923
Sẽn yaa sɩda, a tẽegrã ket n vɩɩme.

00:01:38.003 --> 00:01:47.539
Bobo-Dioulasso pʋgẽ, a yʋʋr wilgdame t'a yaa ned sẽn tar raoodo, sẽn sakd n deegd nebã, la sẽn tar yamã.

00:01:47.619 --> 00:01:59.373
A kibarã tẽegda bũmb sẽn yaa nana: wakat ning sẽn yaa to-to wã, pag n da tõe n tall a zĩiga ne nin-tũusdsã, n kogl a zakã rãmba.
